      en: ["Built in 1537 by the Ottoman Sultan Suleiman the Magnificent.", "The fortress has a nearly square ground plan.", "Two round towers protect the strategic corners of the site.", "The walls reach a maximum thickness of about 2 meters.", "The former village of Lëkurës was once located within the walls.", "The castle is situated approximately 600 meters above sea level."],
