      hu: "Egy 6. századi kora keresztény bazilika romjai a Shkodër melletti híres Mesi-híd közelében.",
      ro: "Ruinele unei bazilici creștine timpurii din secolul al VI-lea, situate lângă celebrul pod Mes din Shkodër.",
      en: "Ruins of an early Christian basilica dating from the 6th century, located near the famous Mes Bridge in Shkodër.",
